  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu brings it out at Gu Yue Village when he interrogates Fang Yuan over Jia Jin Sheng’s disappearance. Gu Yue elders recognise the sealed Gu at once, and Gu Yue Bo names it a rank four Gu that is not easily refined.",
        "chapters": [
          57
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_fu",
          "loc_gu_yue_village",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_jia_jin_sheng",
          "fac_gu_yue_clan",
          "char_gu_yue_bo"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan opens the jade, takes the Gu into his aperture, and answers three questions: whether he harmed Jia Jin Sheng, whether he has other information about him, and whether anything he said earlier was dishonest. He answers no to each. When the Gu comes back out it is still emerald green with no change, which clears him in the hall.",
        "chapters": [
          57
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That clearance is false. Fang Yuan wakes the Spring Autumn Cicada and lets out a trace of its aura. The aura suppresses the Bamboo Gentleman, which shrinks, curls up, and trembles, and cannot detect lies. Under that aura the Gu becomes Fang Yuan’s strongest evidence instead of a threat.",
        "chapters": [
          57
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the test the opened Bamboo Gentleman is extremely weak, has no honesty to restore itself, and after the harsh treatment its death is set in stone. Jia Fu still keeps it and feels no pity.",
        "chapters": [
          57
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A year later he tells Fang Yuan that the Bamboo Gentleman already removed his earlier suspicions.",
        "chapters": [
          113
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu later sends Tie Ruo Nan a letter that records how the bamboo gentleman was used to interrogate Fang Yuan. She treats the unchanged colour as the puzzle: if Fang Yuan were the killer, how did the bamboo gentleman show no change?",
        "chapters": [
          176
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "She later floats the guess that Fang Yuan may have deceived the bamboo gentleman because of a ten extreme physique.",
        "chapters": [
          181
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "jia-fus-interrogation-of-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Old Oracle, a wisdom path Gu Immortal of Ancient Soul Sect, uses an immortal killer move called gentleman’s bamboo. He states that its core is the rank six Immortal Gu Bamboo Gentleman, complemented by six hundred and sixty mortal Gu, and that the move is used specially for detecting lies. The core Immortal Gu is rank six, yet the move can work against rank seven Gu Immortals and not against rank eight. Feng Jiu Ge questions Qin Bai Sheng while Old Oracle grows a colorless crystal bamboo from his palm; the bamboo’s lack of colour change is treated as proof that the answers are truthful.",
        "chapters": [
          768
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "qin-bai-sheng-interrogation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_old_oracle",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "char_feng_jiu_ge",
          "char_qin_bai_sheng"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
